      <h2 class="leap-year-title">\u{41F}\u{435}\u{440}\u{435}\u{432}\u{456}\u{440} \u{432} \u{44F}\u{43A}\u{438}\u{439} \u{440}\u{456}\u{43A} \u{442}\u{438} \u{43D}\u{430}\u{440}\u{43E}\u{434}\u{438}\u{432}\u{441}\u{44F}</h2>
